      ],
      [
        "Performance Features",
        "1. High degree of automation. The whole production line hardly requires manual operation except for equipment start‑stop and daily maintenance.\n2. It features high production efficiency, low operating cost, large output and high profit. The finished aggregate has uniform particle size and good grain shape, meeting national requirements for highway‑use materials.\n3. Adopting closed‑circuit crushing technology, the discharge particle size is adjustable. It delivers high crushing ratio, energy‑saving performance and large output. The produced stone has uniform particle size and favorable grain shape, suitable for various large, medium and small‑scale engineering projects such as highways and bridges.",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      [
        "Working Principle",
        "The system is mainly composed of vibrating feeder, jaw crusher, impact crusher, vibrating screen, belt conveyor and centralized electric control cabinet. Cone crusher and dust removal equipment can be equipped to meet customers’ different processing demands.\n\nLarge‑size stone materials are evenly fed from the hopper into the jaw crusher for primary crushing by the vibrating feeder. The coarsely crushed materials are conveyed by belt conveyor to the impact crusher for further crushing. The finely crushed materials are sent to the vibrating screen for classification. Several specifications of finished stones are separated. Qualified stones are transported to the finished‑product stockpile via finished‑product belt conveyor. Unqualified materials are returned to the impact crusher for re‑crushing through belt conveyor to realize repeated closed‑circuit circulation. The finished particle size can be combined and classified according to user requirements. Auxiliary dust‑removal devices can be installed for environmental protection.",
        "",
